# 刻杨自研 · YouTube 增强覆写（完整版）v1.3.0 / 2026-11-14
# 功能：去广告（重写层 + 脚本层）+ 画中画 + 后台播放（脚本层处理 protobuf：player / get_watch 内嵌 player / get_setting 设置项）
# 用法：在 Stash 里用本文件的远程地址添加覆写即可（脚本已指向下面 script-providers 的 GitHub raw 地址）。
#       仓库：https://github.com/sasigai1/youtube-stash-override
# 注意：带 MitM 的覆写必须在 Stash 里生成并信任 CA 证书才生效；不要用别人的证书。

name: 刻杨自研·YouTube增强
desc: |-
  v1.3.0：body 字节接入改鸭子类型（修 instanceof 跨 realm 误判导致二进制响应被静默放行的嫌疑），并加 [YTE] 诊断日志。
  自研覆写：重写层拦截广告请求，脚本层清广告字段并打开画中画/后台播放（player / get_watch / get_setting 三条链）。
  脚本 fail-open，解析失败自动放行，不挡正常播放。

icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/YouTube.png

http:
  force-http-engine:
    - host: youtubei.googleapis.com
      engine: "jsc"
    - host: "*.googlevideo.com"
      engine: "jsc"
  mitm:
    - "*.googlevideo.com"
    - youtubei.googleapis.com
    - www.youtube.com
    - s.youtube.com
  url-rewrite:
    - ^https?:\/\/[\w-]+\.googlevideo\.com\/(?!(?:dclk_video_ads)).+&ctier=L&.+ ctier 302
    - ^https?:\/\/[\w-]+\.googlevideo\.com\/.+&oad _ reject
    - ^https?:\/\/[\w-]+\.googlevideo\.com\/videoplayback\?.*?&initplayback=true\/?$ - reject
    - https://www.youtube.com/s/player/.*?/player_ias.vflset/.*?/.*?\.js empty.js 302
    - https?:\/\/www\.youtube\.com\/get_midroll_ - reject
    - ^https?:\/\/www\.googlevideo\.com - reject
    - https?:\/\/s0\.2mdn\.net - reject
    - ^https?:\/\/s\.youtube\.com\/api\/stats\/ads - reject
    - ^https?:\/\/www\.youtube\.com\/api\/stats\/ads - reject
    - ^https?:\/\/www\.youtube\.com\/pagead - reject
    - ^https?:\/\/www\.youtube\.com\/ptracking - reject
    - ^https?:\/\/www\.youtube\.com\/api\/stats\/qoe\? - reject
    - ^https?:\/\/[^\/]+\.googlevideo\.com\/.+/player\/ad_break - reject
  script:
    - match: ^https:\/\/youtubei\.googleapis\.com\/youtubei\/v1\/(browse|next|player|search|reel\/reel_watch_sequence|guide|account\/get_setting|get_watch)
      name: YouTubeEnhance
      type: response
      require-body: true
      binary-mode: true
      timeout: 10

script-providers:
  YouTubeEnhance:
    url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sasigai1/youtube-stash-override/main/youtube-enhance.js
    interval: 86400

script:
  argument:

rule:
  - DOMAIN,youtubei.googleapis.com,REJECT,via-interface
    enhancement: true
    name: "Reject QUIC for youtubei"
  - DOMAIN,googlevideo.com,REJECT,via-interface
    enhancement: true
    name: "Reject QUIC for video"
